000300 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000400 PROGRAM-ID. TPLTMAST.
000500 AUTHOR. KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *REMARKS.

000700******************************************************
000800*   T P L T M A S T                     MP1          *
000900*                                                    *
001000*   THIS SUB PROGRAM MODIFIES CORP CODE INFO.        *
001100******************************************************
001200
      *C     JUNE 12, 1992       KURT MOVSESIAN   REQUEST# 6221
      *C      ADDED A NEW INPUT FIELD 'SARA REPORTABLE' ITEM FOR
      *C      CHEMICALS.  USED ONE OF THE STR-STATUS-AREA BYTES IN
      *C      MSTORERM TO SAVE IT.  ALSO ADDED THIS NEW INDICATOR
      *C      TO TC311 ID '6'.  NEW FIELD IS LOCATED BELOW THE
      *C      CONSIGNMENT FIELD.
      *C
      *C  08/14/92  BK DISMUKES  REQUEST #6252
      *C     1. ADDED THE LOGIC TO CALL SRWADDMO (ADD/MODIFY
      *C        CODE RESTRICTIONS).
      *C     2. ADDED THE LOGIC TO CALL SRWREMOV (REMOVE CODE
      *C        RESTRICTIONS)
      *C     3. ALSO ADDED SCREENS FOR SRWADDMO, SRWREMOV TO
      *C        ZPLTMAST.
      *C
      *C    09/13/93  JEFF BUNGO  REQ #6420
      *C        ADDED CALL TO SJOBPCOD TO UPDATE THE UNIT OF MEASURE
      *C        USED ON PM JOBPLANS FOR THE CODE BEING MODIFIED.  ALSO
      *C        UPDATE QUANTITY REQUIRED ON PM JOBPLAN WITH THE NEW
      *C        CONVERSION FACTOR ENTERED.
      *C
      *C    09/21/93  JE COFFMAN  REQ #6374
      *C        ADDED EDIT CHECKING/VALIDATION OF ACCOUNTING CLASS
      *C        FOR GAS ACCOUNTING USERS
      *C
      *C    03/22/94  JE COFFMAN  REQ 94-001/6487 IN SLS
      *C        ADD AN AUTHORIZATION FLAG FIELD FOR CODED ITEMS TO NOT
      *C        ALLOW THEM TO GO THROUGH PURCHASING BUT TO GO THROUGH
      *C        A PLANT-DESIGNATED APPROVAL PATH. THE HOPE IS TO NOT
      *C        ALLOW LARGE COST ITEMS TO BE PURCHASED IF THEY MIGHT
      *C        BE REPAIRABLE.
      *C
      *C
      *C   05/05/94  JE COFFMAN  WRITTEN REQUEST 94-001/SLS REQ 6487
      *C     ADDED THE ABILITY TO SET A NEW AUTHORIZATION FLAG FIELD
      *C     SO THAT REQUISITIONS CUT AGAINST THE CORPORATE CODE MIGHT
      *C     PASS THROUGH AN APPROVAL PATH BEFORE GOING ON TO PURCHASING.
      *C
      *C   06/01/94  JEFF BUNGO  REQUEST #6507/94-032
      *C     ADDED PARAMETER TO SUBROUTINE SRWADDMO FOR TYPE OF
      *C     RESTRICTION.  FOR CODE RESTRICTION THIS PARAMETER
      *C     SHOULD BE SPACES.
      *C
      *C   10/18/1994   CA ZUBEK
      *C    -ADDED A CALL TO THE SUBROUTINE "TALTKEY" ALLOWING THE USER
      *C     TO TYPE IN AN ALTERNATE KEY FOR THE CORPORATE CODE.  THE
      *C     VALUE OF THE CORPORATE CODE CORRESPONDING TO THE ALTERNATE
      *C     KEY IS RETURNED FROM THE SUBROUTINE.
      *C
      *C    -ALSO INCREASED THE SIZE OF THE ENTRY SCREEN CORPORATE
      *C     CODE FIELD TO ALLOW FOR THE 12-BYTE ALTERNATE KEY FIELD.
      *C
      *C   08/06/96     JEFF BUNGO
      *C     RECOMPILE PROGRAM FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE TO PICK UP
      *C     FILE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   11/18/96     JEFF BUNGO  REQ #96-035
      *C     ADD FIELDS FOR ENTRY OF QS9000 EARLY DAYS AND LATE
      *C     DAYS RANGES.  THESE FIELDS WILL BE FORWARDED TO THE
      *C     EARLY AND LATE DAYS ON THE PO ITEM QS9000 TRACKING
      *C     SCREEN AS DEFAULT FOR THE CORPORATE CODE.
      *C
      *C   04/15/97     JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADD FIELD FOR CODE OWNER (FRANCHISER).  DISPLAY NAME
      *C     FROM MPLTINFO TABLE, KEY=FRAN. AND VALIDATE FRANCHISE
      *C     ID FROM THIS KEY.
      *C
      *C   06/24/97     JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADD FRANCHISE IDENTIFIER TO TC 311 RECORD NUMBER 3.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C     ON A UM OF CHANGE, CHANGE VALUES FOR DD USAGE BY
      *C     MULTIPLYING BY CONVERSION FACTOR.
      *C
      *C 01/12/98     JEFF BUNGO
      *C     RETRIEVE THE LOCAL DATA AREA TO GET THE ORIGINATING
      *C     GLOBAL MENU TRANS USED TO CALL THIS PROGRAM.  IF
      *C     THE TRANSACTION IS MP1I (ISC MP1) PROTECT THE MKT COST,
      *C     STD COST, AND QS9000 FIELDS USING INDICATOR 96.
      *C
      *C   06/07/99   CA YODER   (DECATUR REQUEST)
      *C     RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP MTAX DATABASE CHANGE TO
      *C     EXPAND TAX RATE PERCENTAGE FROM 2 DECIMAL PLACES TO 4.
      *C
      *C   09/13/04   CA YODER   REQUEST #2004-51605
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO CHANGE UNIT OF MEASURE AND UNIT QUANTITIES
      *C     IN CSAS WHEN THE PRIMARY UM IS CHANGED IN CSIS.
      *C
BEG01 *C   12/09/04   BE GEISER  REQUEST #2004-51605
BEG01 *C     CHANGED LOGIC TO ONLY CHECK CSAS ONLY IF THE PRIMARY UM CHANGED.
      *C
007600
