           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-1.
070800
070900     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
071000         MOVE "Y"  TO  EOJ-SW
071100         GO TO 61-WFS-X
071200     ELSE
072500     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
072600        VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
072700        VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
072800        VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
072900        VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
073000        VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
073200***      INVALID FUNCTION KEY
073300         MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
073400         MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
073500         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
073700         MOVE 2  TO  FIELD-NUMBER
073800         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
073900         GO TO 61-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.

      *-------- FIELD EDITS
           IF DE-CODE-ENTRY = SPACES
      *         YOU MUST ENTER A CORPORATE CODE
               MOVE 66170 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
069800         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
069900         MOVE 2  TO FIELD-NUMBER
070000         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
070100         GO TO 61-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.
075900
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *  10/18/94           C A ZUBEK                             *
      *  LOGIC TO CALL THE SUBROUTINE "TALTKEY" TO SEE IF USER    *
      *  ENTERED AN ALTERNATE KEY.  IF SO, THE CORPORATE CODE     *
      *  WILL BE RETURNED.                                        *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

           MOVE DE-CODE-ENTRY           TO ALT-KEY-ARG.
           CALL "TALTKEY" USING RET-CODE,
                                BASE-TALTKEY,
                                STATUS-AREA,
                                ALT-KEY-ARG,
                                ALT-CORP-CODE.
           MOVE ALT-CORP-CODE           TO CODE-ARG.
           IF RET-CODE NOT EQUAL "00"
               MOVE "TALTKEY ERROR 62-UCC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           MOVE ALT-CORP-CODE             TO CODE-ARG.

           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-O.
           READ MSTORERM-O INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
076400     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
076500         IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
076600***          STORES CODE DOES NOT EXIST
076700             MOVE  19 TO LANG-SETNUM
076800             MOVE   9 TO LANG-MSGNUM
076900             PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
077100             MOVE CODE-ARG  TO  MSG-FLD
077200             MOVE 2         TO  FIELD-NUMBER
077300             PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
077400             GO TO 61-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1
077500         ELSE
077600             MOVE "DBGET 61-GET-CODE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
077700             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-O.
           START MSTORERM-O KEY > CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
077800
077900 61-WFS-X.
078000     EXIT.
078100
078200*********************************************
078300*                                           *
078400*    UPDATE CORP CODE SECTION               *
078500*                                           *
078600*********************************************
078700*                                           *
078800*   WRITE SCREEN 2 'PLTMAST2' OR 'PLTMAST2B'*
078900*   DEPENDING ON KEY 'PAVG' IN MPLTINFO.    *
079000*   KEY IS BUILT THROUGH PLTSTUP IF USER    *
079100*   DECIDES TO ALLOW THE MODIFICATION OF    *
079200*   AVG. COST FIGURES.                      *
079300*********************************************
079400
079500 62-UPDATE-CORP-CODE.
079600     MOVE "PAVG"  TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           START MPLTINFO-I KEY = PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
080000         MOVE "PLTMAST2"           TO  VIEW-NFNAME
080100     ELSE
080200         MOVE "PLTMAST2B"         TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
080300
