      **** IF PLANT IS RUNNING CSAS - CHECK ACTIVITY DATE
           IF CSAS-FLAG = "Y"
               IF HOLD-DATE-CN = STR-ACT-DATE-CN
      ***  ACTIVITY HAS BEEN POSTED TODAY - NO PROCESSING ALLOWED
                   MOVE  66 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 246 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE 27 TO  FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
                   GO TO 62-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2
               END-IF
               IF HOLD-DATE-CN = CLOSING-DATE-CN OR
                  HOLD-DATE-CN > CLOSING-DATE-CN
      ***  CSAS END-OF-MONTH-PROCEDURE IN PROGRESS - NO PROCESSING
                   MOVE  66 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 243 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE 27 TO  FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
                   GO TO 62-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2
               END-IF
      *------ CHECK TO SEE IF ALL "ABSTFILES" HAVE BEEN PROCESSED INTO
      *------ CSAS
               IF CSAS-SEQ < CSIS-SEQ AND CSAS-SEQ NOT = ZEROS
      *** CSIS CUTOFF FILES WAITING TO BE PROCESSED INTO CSAS -
      *** NO PROCESSING DONE
                   MOVE  66 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 242 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE 27 TO  FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
                   GO TO 62-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2
               END-IF
      *------ CHECK TO SEE IF ALL ACCOUNTS PAYABLE MANIFEST FILES
      *------ HAVE BEEN PROCESSED INTO CSAS
               MOVE "MANSTR01"   TO CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME
               CALL "CCHKOBJ" USING CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME,
                                    CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS
               IF CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS = "00"
      *** MANIFEST WAITING TO BE PROCESSED -
      *** NO PROCESSING DONE
                   MOVE  66 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 245 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE 27 TO  FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
                   GO TO 62-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2.

