190800******************************************************
190900*                                                    *
191000*   SINCE A DECIMAL CONVERSION FACTOR CAN BE ENTERED *
191100*   A CHECK TO MAKE SURE THE TOTAL STR-ONHAND EQUALS *
191200*   ALL THE BIN LOCATIONS. THE DIFFERENCE IS A       *
191300*   RESULT OF TRUNCATING THE DECIMAL PORTION OF THE  *
191400*   TOTAL ONHAND AND BIN LOCATION ONHANDS. ANY       *
191500*   DIFFERENCE IS ADDED TO THE PRIMARY BIN LOCATION  *
191600*   (LOC1). THE TOTAL AND BIN LOCATION ONHAND        *
191700*   VALUES (BOTH OLD AND NEW) ARE SHOWN ON THE       *
191800*   CONVERSION SCREEN                                *
191900*                                                    *
192000******************************************************
192100
192200     ADD LOC1-SAVE, LOC2-SAVE, LOC3-SAVE, LOC4-SAVE,
192300         LOC5-SAVE, LOC6-SAVE  GIVING  TOTAL-LOCS-SAVE.
192400     IF TOTAL-LOCS-SAVE = NEW-ONHAND
192500         NEXT SENTENCE
192600     ELSE
192700     IF TOTAL-LOCS-SAVE < NEW-ONHAND
192800         SUBTRACT TOTAL-LOCS-SAVE  FROM  NEW-ONHAND
192900             GIVING LOC-DIFF-SAVE
193000         ADD LOC-DIFF-SAVE  TO  LOC1-SAVE.
193100
193200     MULTIPLY DE-MAX BY DE-CONV-FACTOR GIVING NEW-MAX.
193300     MULTIPLY DE-REORDER BY DE-CONV-FACTOR GIVING NEW-REORD.
193400     MULTIPLY DE-EXPEDITE BY DE-CONV-FACTOR GIVING NEW-EXPEDITE.
193500     MULTIPLY DE-SOQ BY DE-CONV-FACTOR GIVING NEW-SOQ.
193600     DIVIDE DE-AVG-COST BY DE-CONV-FACTOR GIVING NEW-AVGCST.
193700     DIVIDE DE-MKT-COST BY DE-CONV-FACTOR GIVING NEW-MKTCST.
193800     MULTIPLY DE-UM1-CF BY DE-CONV-FACTOR GIVING
193900                             NEW-UM1-CF.
194000     MULTIPLY DE-UM2-CF BY DE-CONV-FACTOR GIVING
194100                             NEW-UM2-CF.
