194300     MOVE NEW-MAX              TO DISP-NEW-MAX.
194400     MOVE NEW-REORD            TO DISP-NEW-REORD.
194500     MOVE NEW-EXPEDITE         TO DISP-NEW-EXPEDITE.
194600     MOVE NEW-SOQ              TO DISP-NEW-SOQ.
