               GO TO 62-UPDATE-CSAS.
284000     MOVE 1                         TO DATE-MODE.
284100     CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
284200     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT              TO DDAILYTC-DATE.
284300     ACCEPT DDAILYTC-TIME FROM TIME.
