284500     MOVE PASS-COMPANY-CODE         TO DDAILYTC-PLT.
284600     MOVE SPACES                    TO BUF-TC334.
284700     MOVE OLD-CLASS-SAVE            TO TC334-OLD-CLASS.
284800     MOVE CORP-CODE                 TO TC334-CORP-CODE
284900                                       TC334-NEW-CODE.
